<title>ITALY: Gross yield rises at Italian 30-yr BTP sale.</title>
<headline>Gross yield rises at Italian 30-yr BTP sale.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a 13th tranche of 1.5 trillion lire worth of 30-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (Btp) with a 7.25 pct coupon.</p>
<p>		     Nov 1, 2026	    Pvs</p>
<p> Net Yield	 6.39 pct		 6.36</p>
<p> Gross Yield     7.33 pct		 7.29</p>
<p> Assigned price 100.55		  100.95</p>
<p> Bids	     2.337 trln lire</p>
<p> Assigned	 1.500 trln lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparison is with a previous auction on July 15.</p>
</text>
